[EN]
2.0.0
  * build system: autotools replaced with CMake (min. 3.16, C17); tcp-wrappers
    support removed
  * code modernization: sigaction(), inet_pton(), poll() instead of select(),
    C17 headers, no deprecated APIs
  * security & correctness campaign: static analysis (flawfinder/cppcheck/
    gcc -fanalyzer), ThreadSanitizer/AddressSanitizer clean; remote $MyINFO
    buffer overflow and other real defects fixed; single recursive user lock
    removes all data races
  * performance: hash command dispatch, nick->index hash (~100x faster
    nick2id), in-place receive buffers, FD_SETSIZE landmine removed
  * passwords in dcd.users may be salted SHA-512 hashes ($sha512$salt$hex,
    OpenSSL libcrypto); dcd.adduser generates them
  * runtime telemetry: console `stats` (traffic, per-command counts,
    user rotation)
  * embedded HTTP endpoint: web console (/console), web chat (/ with /chatws
    JSON protocol), /healthcheck; web pages are editable config files
    (dcd.webchat, dcd.webconsole)
  * Docker support: multi-stage Dockerfile, entrypoint with DCD_* config
    overrides, syslog-forward helper, HEALTHCHECK via /healthcheck
  * unit + perf test suites (ctest) and a Python end-to-end NMDC/console/
    web suite

